mber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「うちもすぐに電脳組の一員になるさかい。」と言って、突然現れた大阪娘、泉岳寺かもめ。彼女の登場で騒然となるひばりたち。果たして、かもめの目的は何なのだろうか？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1999-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cwAg9HavbQcNNSwwkKwiymi79bR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cwAg9HavbQcNNSwwkKwiymi79bR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"576695","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"いつもと変わらない朝。そんな穏やかな日常に突然の出来事が起こった。ひばりの靴箱の中になんとラブレターが入っていたのだ。だが、その差し出し人は、ちょっと普通じゃない女の子で…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1999-08-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d38DIFHjVTkpWEcIZyD9UOMifx8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d38DIFHjVTkpWEcIZyD9UOMifx8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"576690","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"たまたま同じ列車に乗り合わせたじゅん、みやま、はとこの三人。彼女たちの行く先は同じ宿だった。実はその温泉宿には、三人のそれぞれの思い出がつまっていて…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-05-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5s8Lo9clKeFv45l6Vd7PzLY9Hf0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5s8Lo9clKeFv45l6Vd7PzLY9Hf0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"576672","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"アキハバラの中心部地下に広がるアンダーアミューズメントパーク。無人のその場所で今、敵の総攻撃が始まった。果たして、ディーヴァを召還できないひばりたちに勝算はあるのか？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-06-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zVecADzZu7zdKQqIKQ7LTXpp3Cq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zVecADzZu7zdKQqIKQ7LTXpp3Cq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"576673","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"夢の中の王子様に会いたくてしょうがないひばりは、下校途中、雨の中走る車に水をかけられてしまった。だが、なんとその車から降りて出てきたのは、ひばりの王子様で…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-06-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3K47HOAc0dtxM6I5bp9X8wziggr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3K47HOAc0dtxM6I5bp9X8wziggr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"576674","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"パワーアップしたブラッドファルコンらの攻撃に成す術もないすずめ、つぐみ、かもめ。彼女たちが絶体絶命の中、炎の中から現れたのは黒いディーヴァだった。果たして、その黒いディーヴァは敵か味方か？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-06-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1rH16wglFGWr8QF9XN85SMmiwzW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1rH16wglFGWr8QF9XN85SMmiwzW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"576675","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ひばりたちのクラスに、大鳥居つばめというフランスからの転校生がやってきた。つばめの冷静で危険な行動に彼女を敬遠するクラスメイトたちだったが、ひばりはつばめと友だちになりたいと思って…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-06-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hh8O7C7WFjnt6IHMCi1mHS4YIw8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hh8O7C7WFjnt6IHMCi1mHS4YIw8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"576676","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"時はさかのぼって、19世紀末のヨーロッパ。そこには、鷲羽ことクリスチャン・ローゼンクロイツとシゴーニュ、そしてひばりの王子様であるクレイン・バーシュタイクの姿があって…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-07-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nUcKtncTyxUpNiEFrE5mEUppnB7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nUcKtncTyxUpNiEFrE5mEUppnB7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"576677","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"わ〜い夏だということで、ひばりたちはパタPiたちを連れて夏の海へとやってきた。初めて見る海に驚きを隠せないデンスケたち。今、パタPiたちの大冒険が始まる!!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-07-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ysRii6dxzVhoLhIXryt4W8fPFHy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ysRii6dxzVhoLhIXryt4W8fPFHy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"576678","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"普段は明るい彼女たちだが、それぞれに哀しみを胸に秘めて生きてきた。幼い頃、弟の名前にデンスケをつけようと考えていたひばりなど、アニマ・ムンディの過去が明らかになる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-07-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tefxtY8ygxd74dvsXMLWx1fhf0l.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tefxtY8ygxd74dvsXMLWx1fhf0l.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"576679","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"エリヌースの作り出すタキオンフィールドに誘われたひばり。そこには、ひばり、つばめ、黒の王子だけがいた。絶体絶命の状態の中、ひばりはアフロディーテと霊機融合を果たして…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dujbPmTrVyTW7Mhx2adDWHq3cwd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dujbPmTrVyTW7Mhx2adDWHq3cwd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"576696","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"受け入れられぬ愛ゆえに生み出された存在、鷹士。そんな自らの生い立ちに、絶望し存在意義を見い出そうと必死になる鷹士を受け止めるのは、じゅん、みやま、はとこたちだった…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-08-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Lb0gNWJhFNimRAtLWQ3RZVmq4i.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Lb0gNWJhFNimRAtLWQ3RZVmq4i.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"576680","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takashi takes his farewell of Washuu, who shows no particular emotion about it. \"\"From now on, you should search for a way to live as an individual.\"\"    Tsubame is trying to repair her Petit Ange... or remake it. To her, who thinks strength is the most important thing, a Pata Pi who has lost a battle is simply useless. Cigogne comes to the room and offers his help. Tsubame refuses it; \"\"Leave me alone. I'll repair it myself.\"\" He lets the young girl have her way but notices the small bear doll on the desk. She says someone gave it to her. He doesn't ask further question and leaves the room. \"\"If you have any trouble in the repair, come to me any time.\"\".    At the school, Suzume, Tsugumi and Hibari are shocked to hear that Hibari has experienced gattai. While Hibari is worried about Tsubane, who was hurt because of her gattai, the three girls are busy discussing the issue. The fact that Hibari, who was thought to be the least mature of the four, has reached the critical point before them sh","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-08-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p6Sz1o9qY95V683o7SR1vzXLFy9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p6Sz1o9qY95V683o7SR1vzXLFy9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"576681","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tsubame stands alone in a busy street [near Bansei-bashi] but no one pays any attention to her. Then a voice of Hibari is heard, \"\"Tsubame-chan!!\"\"    A TV news reports the unidentified object which appeared a few days ago. But Hanakoganei Hinako is more concerned about her daughter. When she tells her daughter the bath is ready, she answers from her room, \"\"I'll take it later.\"\" Her daughter, Hibari, is talking to injured Densuke. \"\"I'll repair you properly tomorrow.\"\" She is confused. What the difference between her and their [the three ladies and perhaps Takashi] feeling? But her profound question is interrupted by her mother, who is dangerously determined to have a bath with her. She carries her on her back and rushes into the bathroom. Seeing this, Tokijirou bemoans being a male parent but finds consolation in his male company, Densuke.    Subtitle    After a bath, Hibari enjoys fruits-flavour milk [milk after having a bath is tradition in Japan  but anything other than coffee milk is a","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-08-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xtEAK3pCwLtj7QHqBukEvHTKZW3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xtEAK3pCwLtj7QHqBukEvHTKZW3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"576691","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"もう誰も傷つけたくない。そして自分を守る強さではなく、誰かを、友達を守る強さを手に入れたいと他人に対して心を開き始めたつばめ。彼女は、襲いかかる敵を前に自ら楯となり…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1999-11-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sqHQJevM532TajFkwjb6ogq7DiW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sqHQJevM532TajFkwjb6ogq7DiW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"576682","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"すべてはプリムムモビーレを降下させること、そしてその中で眠るメタトロンの覚醒の為であり、肉体という頸城から精神を解放する為…。そんなローゼンクロイツの目的が明らかになる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-08-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jL7hZbuzSNi6KQbyvXpi0SaVU24.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jL7hZbuzSNi6KQbyvXpi0SaVU24.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"576692","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"突如衛星軌道上に出現し、アキハバラへ降下し始めたプリムムモビーレ。ひばりたちは、校長の企みを阻止する為、そして白の王子を救う為にプリムムモビーレに向かい…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-09-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iqAMF7WaRtIbUIuYZWVvqTJgSks.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iqAMF7WaRtIbUIuYZWVvqTJgSks.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"576683","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ローゼンクロイツはクレインとの再会を果たした。そして、いよいよローゼンクロイツの野望が成就するかに思われたその時、突きつけられる現実はあまりに過酷であった…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-09-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dNooRJqOBsSTZc9GpCQR7sAxovq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dNooRJqOBsSTZc9GpCQR7sAxovq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"576693","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ひばりに「あと165日たったら迎えにくる…」と言い残して、白の王子は再び宇宙へと旅立った。アニマ・ムンディとしての使命を前に、ひばりは思い悩み…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-09-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3gaUQC5WukMB4wuy6v2LnLR9bMD.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3gaUQC5WukMB4wuy6v2LnLR9bMD.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"576697","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「僕の百年は一体何だったんだ!!」と言うクレイン。「デンスケと過ごした一年は、どんな百年にも絶対に負けてない!!」と言うひばり。そんなひばりとデンスケ、そしてすずめたちとそのパタPiたちとの絆は奇跡を起こす！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1998-09-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dhfgMeevPV91vSXgotrJXjjw32e.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dhfgMeevPV91vSXgotrJXjjw32e.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1/episode/26"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/19697/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793435871498,"status":"ok","retryCount":0}